[["Map",1,2,97,98,105,106],"blog",["Map",3,4],"en/blog/phases-all",{"id":3,"data":5,"body":18,"filePath":19,"digest":20,"rendered":21},{"title":6,"description":7,"date":8,"tags":9,"illustration":12,"color":13,"author":14},"All Development Phases","Complete record of all development phases of the Cosmos digital garden",["Date","2026-08-28T21:00:00.000Z"],[10,11],"Testing","Dev","/personal_garden/images/burial-sarah-rawscan.jpg","#6b7b4b",{"name":15,"avatar":16,"bio":17},"Geo Mas","https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217055154?s=120&v=4","Electrical and Computer Engineering student. Builder of things.","## Phase 1 — Code Block Enhancements\n\nEach block has a copy button, a language badge, and line numbers.\n\n### Line highlight `{1-3}`\n\n```ts {1-3}\nconst greeting = \"hello world\";\nconst count = greeting.length;\nconst upper = greeting.toUpperCase();\nconsole.log(upper, count);\n```\n\n### Word highlight `/const`\n\n```ts /const/\nconst a = 1;\nlet b = 2;\nconst c = a + b;\n```\n\n### Combined: highlight lines 2-3 and the word `return`\n\n```python {2-3} /return/\ndef add(x, y):\n    total = x + y\n    return total\n```\n\n### Plain block (still gets copy + badge + line numbers)\n\n```bash\nnpm run dev -- --port 3001\nastro build\n```\n\n### Optional path / title\n\nAdd `title=\"path/to/file\"` to the fence to show a file path in the header.\nThe language label is shown automatically on every block.\n\n```ts title=\"src/components/Header.astro\" {1-3}\nconst BASE = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;\nfunction updateThemeIcon() {}\nexport default updateThemeIcon;\n```\n\nInline `code` also keeps its styling.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2 — Emoji Shortcodes\n\nType a shortcode like `:rocket:` and it renders as an emoji automatically :rocket:. Try a few below.\n\n### Built-in shortcodes\n\n- Celebrate :tada: ship it :rocket: and review :eyes:\n- Plants :seedling: :herb: :sunflower: :evergreen_tree:\n- Weather :sunny: :cloud: :rainbow: :zap:\n- Writing :memo: :books: :bulb: :star:\n\nInline sentence with emojis :wave: hope this works :crossed_fingers:!\n\n### Emoticons\n\nOld-school emoticons are also supported — `:)` `:(` `;)` `:P` `:D`\nbecome :smile: :slightly_frowning_face: :wink: :stuck_out_tongue: :grin:.\n\n### Accessibility\n\nWith accessible mode on, each emoji is wrapped in\n`\u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"rocket emoji\">` so screen readers\nannounce the name. Inspect the :rocket: above to confirm.\n\n### Custom emoji via directive\n\nThe existing `::directive{}` pattern still works alongside shortcodes.\nFor example a tip directive :tip[hover me]{def=\"Custom emoji shortcodes render via remark-emoji, while this tooltip is a remark-directive.\"} stays interactive, while\n`:rocket:` stays a plain emoji — no conflict because emoji runs first.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3 — Enhanced Link Cards\n\nA link placed on its own line should render as a full **rich card** (image + title + description + domain). A link inside a sentence should keep the **hover popup**.\n\n### Bare link → rich card\n\nPut a URL alone in a paragraph like this:\n\nhttps://github.com/withastro/astro\n\nThe above should appear as a styled card after the build fetches its\nOpen Graph metadata. If the site blocks fetching, it falls back to the\ndomain name as the title.\n\n### Inline link → hover popup\n\nHere is an inline reference to the [Astro docs](https://docs.astro.build/)\nthat should still show a small popup on hover, not a full card.\n\nAnother inline example with [Expressive Code](https://expressive-code.com/)\nto confirm the hover behavior is unchanged for in-sentence links.\n\n### Rich card with markdown detail\n\nUse the `:::linkcard` directive to attach rich markdown content that\nopens in a modal when the card is clicked:\n\n:::linkcard{url=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro\"}\nThis is **markdown detail content** rendered inside the modal window,\njust like a normal post. It supports:\n\n- Lists and `inline code`\n- Math: $E = mc^2$\n- Code blocks and even :rocket: emoji\n\n> Click the card above to open the detailed view.\n:::\n\nA bare link (no detail) should still open a modal showing the fetched\nOG info plus a *Visit site* button.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4 — Media Embedding\n\nYouTube/bare-link auto-embed, Bilibili, self-hosted video, ambient player, and subtitle mining with live transcript.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5 — i18n & Pinyin Ruby\n\nThe entire UI now supports three languages:\n\n- **English** (EN) — default locale\n- **German** (DE) — full translation\n- **Chinese** (ZH) — full translation with pinyin ruby support\n\n### URL Structure\n\nAll pages now use locale-prefixed URLs:\n\n- `/personal_garden/en/` — English home\n- `/personal_garden/de/` — German home\n- `/personal_garden/zh/` — Chinese home\n\n### Pinyin Ruby\n\nThe `:zh[...]{pinyin=\"...\"}` syntax renders Chinese characters with pinyin annotations above them using HTML `\u003Cruby>` elements.\n\n### Language Switcher\n\nA language switcher component has been added to the header, allowing users to toggle between EN, DE, and ZH.\n\n### Tag Translations\n\nTags are automatically translated based on the current locale. For example, \"development\" becomes \"Entwicklung\" in German and \"开发\" in Chinese.","src/content/en/blog/phases-all.md","d409b0727c270391",{"html":22,"metadata":23},"\u003Ch2 id=\"phase-1--code-block-enhancements\">Phase 1 — Code Block Enhancements\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Each block has a copy button, a language badge, and line numbers.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"line-highlight-1-3\">Line highlight \u003Ccode>{1-3}\u003C/code>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"expressive-code\">\u003Clink rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/personal_garden/en/_astro/ec.j6cfh.css\">\u003Cscript type=\"module\" src=\"/personal_garden/en/_astro/ec.0vx5m.js\">\u003C/script>\u003Cfigure class=\"frame\">\u003Cfigcaption class=\"header\">\u003C/figcaption>\u003Cpre data-language=\"ts\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line highlight mark\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--1:#d69494\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934\">const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#004fa9;--1:#c2a076\">greeting\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#d69494\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#a5a5a5\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#d69494\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#cf988c\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#cf988c\">hello world\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#cf988c\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line highlight mark\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--1:#d69494\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934\">const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#004fa9;--1:#c2a076\">count\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#d69494\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#a5a5a5\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#d69494\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#c2a076\">greeting\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#004fa9;--1:#B8A965\">length\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line highlight mark\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--1:#d69494\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934\">const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#004fa9;--1:#c2a076\">upper\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#d69494\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#a5a5a5\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#d69494\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#c2a076\">greeting\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#613aa9;--1:#8daf75\">toUpperCase\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">();\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#BD976A\">console\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#8B8B8B\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#80A665\">log\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#8B8B8B\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#BD976A\">upper\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#8B8B8B\">,\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#BD976A\">count\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#8B8B8B\">);\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cdiv class=\"copy\">\u003Cdiv aria-live=\"polite\">\u003C/div>\u003Cbutton title=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-copied=\"Copied!\" data-code=\"const greeting = &#x22;hello world&#x22;;const count = greeting.length;const upper = greeting.toUpperCase();console.log(upper, count);\">\u003Cdiv>\u003C/div>\u003C/button>\u003C/div>\u003C/figure>\u003C/div>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"word-highlight-const\">Word highlight \u003Ccode>/const\u003C/code>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"expressive-code\">\u003Cfigure class=\"frame\">\u003Cfigcaption class=\"header\">\u003C/figcaption>\u003Cpre data-language=\"ts\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cmark>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#d69494\">const\u003C/span>\u003C/mark>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#CB7676\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#BD976A\">a\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#CB7676\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#8B8B8B\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#CB7676\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#4C9A91\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#8B8B8B\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--1:#CB7676\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#BF3441\">let\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#BD976A\">b\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#CB7676\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#8B8B8B\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#CB7676\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#4C9A91\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#8B8B8B\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cmark>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#d69494\">const\u003C/span>\u003C/mark>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#CB7676\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#BD976A\">c\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#CB7676\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#8B8B8B\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#CB7676\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#BD976A\">a\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--1:#CB7676\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#BF3441\">+\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#BD976A\">b\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#8B8B8B\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cdiv class=\"copy\">\u003Cdiv aria-live=\"polite\">\u003C/div>\u003Cbutton title=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-copied=\"Copied!\" data-code=\"const a = 1;let b = 2;const c = a + b;\">\u003Cdiv>\u003C/div>\u003C/button>\u003C/div>\u003C/figure>\u003C/div>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"combined-highlight-lines-2-3-and-the-word-return\">Combined: highlight lines 2-3 and the word \u003Ccode>return\u003C/code>\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"expressive-code\">\u003Cfigure class=\"frame\">\u003Cfigcaption class=\"header\">\u003C/figcaption>\u003Cpre data-language=\"python\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#CB7676\">def\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#80A665\">add\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#8B8B8B\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\">x\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#8B8B8B\">,\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> y\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#8B8B8B\">):\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line highlight mark\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan class=\"indent\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\">    \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\">total \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#a5a5a5\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> x \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#d69494\">+\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> y\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line highlight mark\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan class=\"indent\">    \u003C/span>\u003Cmark>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#83242d;--1:#99c1b0\">return\u003C/span>\u003C/mark>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> total\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cdiv class=\"copy\">\u003Cdiv aria-live=\"polite\">\u003C/div>\u003Cbutton title=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-copied=\"Copied!\" data-code=\"def add(x, y):    total = x + y    return total\">\u003Cdiv>\u003C/div>\u003C/button>\u003C/div>\u003C/figure>\u003C/div>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plain-block-still-gets-copy--badge--line-numbers\">Plain block (still gets copy + badge + line numbers)\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"expressive-code\">\u003Cfigure class=\"frame is-terminal\">\u003Cfigcaption class=\"header\">\u003Cspan class=\"title\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\">Terminal window\u003C/span>\u003C/figcaption>\u003Cpre data-language=\"bash\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#80A665\">npm\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#C98A7D\">run\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#C98A7D\">dev\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#C99076\">--\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#C99076\">--port\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#4C9A91\">3001\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#80A665\">astro\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#C98A7D\">build\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cdiv class=\"copy\">\u003Cdiv aria-live=\"polite\">\u003C/div>\u003Cbutton title=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-copied=\"Copied!\" data-code=\"npm run dev -- --port 3001astro build\">\u003Cdiv>\u003C/div>\u003C/button>\u003C/div>\u003C/figure>\u003C/div>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"optional-path--title\">Optional path / title\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Add \u003Ccode>title=\"path/to/file\"\u003C/code> to the fence to show a file path in the header.\nThe language label is shown automatically on every block.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"expressive-code\">\u003Cfigure class=\"frame has-title\">\u003Cfigcaption class=\"header\">\u003Cspan class=\"title\">src/components/Header.astro\u003C/span>\u003C/figcaption>\u003Cpre data-language=\"ts\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line highlight mark\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--1:#d69494\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934\">const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E\"> \u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#004fa9;--1:#c2a076\">BASE\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#d69494\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#a5a5a5\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#d69494\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#7db09a\">import\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#004fa9;--1:#B8A965\">meta\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#c2a076\">env\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#004fa9;--1:#c2a076\">BASE_URL\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line highlight mark\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#d69494\">function\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#613aa9;--1:#8daf75\">updateThemeIcon\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">()\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">{}\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line highlight mark\">\u003Cdiv class=\"gutter\">\u003Cdiv class=\"ln\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#7db09a\">export\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#982934;--1:#7db09a\">default\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#DBD7CAEE\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#c2a076\">updateThemeIcon\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#a5a5a5\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cdiv class=\"copy\">\u003Cdiv aria-live=\"polite\">\u003C/div>\u003Cbutton title=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-copied=\"Copied!\" data-code=\"const BASE = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;function updateThemeIcon() {}export default updateThemeIcon;\">\u003Cdiv>\u003C/div>\u003C/button>\u003C/div>\u003C/figure>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Inline \u003Ccode>code\u003C/code> also keeps its styling.\u003C/p>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phase-2--emoji-shortcodes\">Phase 2 — Emoji Shortcodes\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Type a shortcode like \u003Ccode>:rocket:\u003C/code> and it renders as an emoji automatically \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"rocket emoji\">🚀\u003C/span>. Try a few below.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"built-in-shortcodes\">Built-in shortcodes\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Celebrate \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"tada emoji\">🎉\u003C/span> ship it \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"rocket emoji\">🚀\u003C/span> and review \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"eyes emoji\">👀\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Plants \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"seedling emoji\">🌱\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"herb emoji\">🌿\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"sunflower emoji\">🌻\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"evergreen tree emoji\">🌲\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Weather \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"sunny emoji\">☀️\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"cloud emoji\">☁️\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"rainbow emoji\">🌈\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"zap emoji\">⚡\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Writing \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"memo emoji\">📝\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"books emoji\">📚\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"bulb emoji\">💡\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"star emoji\">⭐\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>Inline sentence with emojis \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"wave emoji\">👋\u003C/span> hope this works \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"crossed fingers emoji\">🤞\u003C/span>!\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"emoticons\">Emoticons\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Old-school emoticons are also supported — \u003Ccode>:)\u003C/code> \u003Ccode>:(\u003C/code> \u003Ccode>;)\u003C/code> \u003Ccode>:P\u003C/code> \u003Ccode>:D\u003C/code>\nbecome \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"smile emoji\">😄\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"slightly frowning face emoji\">🙁\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"wink emoji\">😉\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"stuck out tongue emoji\">😛\u003C/span> \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"grin emoji\">😁\u003C/span>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"accessibility\">Accessibility\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>With accessible mode on, each emoji is wrapped in\n\u003Ccode>&#x3C;span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"rocket emoji\">\u003C/code> so screen readers\nannounce the name. Inspect the \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"rocket emoji\">🚀\u003C/span> above to confirm.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"custom-emoji-via-directive\">Custom emoji via directive\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>The existing \u003Ccode>::directive{}\u003C/code> pattern still works alongside shortcodes.\nFor example a tip directive \u003Cspan class=\"glossary-tip\" data-tooltip=\"Custom emoji shortcodes render via remark-emoji, while this tooltip is a remark-directive.\" tabindex=\"0\">hover me\u003C/span> stays interactive, while\n\u003Ccode>:rocket:\u003C/code> stays a plain emoji — no conflict because emoji runs first.\u003C/p>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phase-3--enhanced-link-cards\">Phase 3 — Enhanced Link Cards\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>A link placed on its own line should render as a full \u003Cstrong>rich card\u003C/strong> (image + title + description + domain). A link inside a sentence should keep the \u003Cstrong>hover popup\u003C/strong>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"bare-link--rich-card\">Bare link → rich card\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Put a URL alone in a paragraph like this:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"og-card-wrap\">\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro\" data-og-title=\"GitHub - withastro/astro: The web framework for content-driven websites.\" data-og-description=\"The web framework for content-driven websites. Contribute to withastro/astro development by creating an account on GitHub.\" data-og-image=\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/5949579494ced88596510addffd256c8cc11bc848ebea68ef8f6158b14f224ae/withastro/astro\" class=\"og-card-link\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/5949579494ced88596510addffd256c8cc11bc848ebea68ef8f6158b14f224ae/withastro/astro\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"og-card-img\">\u003Cspan class=\"og-card-title\">GitHub - withastro/astro: The web framework for content-driven websites.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"og-card-desc\">The web framework for content-driven websites. Contribute to withastro/astro development by creating an account on GitHub.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"og-card-domain\">github.com\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>The above should appear as a styled card after the build fetches its\nOpen Graph metadata. If the site blocks fetching, it falls back to the\ndomain name as the title.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"inline-link--hover-popup\">Inline link → hover popup\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Here is an inline reference to the \u003Ca href=\"https://docs.astro.build/\" data-og-title=\"docs.astro.build\">Astro docs\u003C/a>\nthat should still show a small popup on hover, not a full card.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Another inline example with \u003Ca href=\"https://expressive-code.com/\" data-og-title=\"Expressive Code\" data-og-description=\"Present your source code on the web, making it easy to understand and visually stunning. All&#x26;#38;nbsp;batteries included!\" data-og-image=\"https://expressive-code.com/open-graph/index.png\">Expressive Code\u003C/a>\nto confirm the hover behavior is unchanged for in-sentence links.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"rich-card-with-markdown-detail\">Rich card with markdown detail\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Use the \u003Ccode>:::linkcard\u003C/code> directive to attach rich markdown content that\nopens in a modal when the card is clicked:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"og-card-wrap linkcard\" data-url=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro\">\u003Ca href=\"#\" class=\"og-card-link og-card-link--invalid\" data-og-title=\"Link\">\u003Cspan class=\"og-card-title\">Link\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"og-card-domain\">\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003Cdiv class=\"linkcard-detail\" hidden>\u003Cp>This is \u003Cstrong>markdown detail content\u003C/strong> rendered inside the modal window,\njust like a normal post. It supports:\u003C/p>\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Lists and \u003Ccode>inline code\u003C/code>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Math: \u003Cspan class=\"katex\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003Cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\u003Csemantics>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi>E\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>=\u003C/mo>\u003Cmi>m\u003C/mi>\u003Cmsup>\u003Cmi>c\u003C/mi>\u003Cmn>2\u003C/mn>\u003C/msup>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = mc^2\u003C/annotation>\u003C/semantics>\u003C/math>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mrel\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">m\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">c\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"msupsub\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-t\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\">\u003Cspan style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\">\u003Cspan class=\"mord mtight\">2\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Code blocks and even \u003Cspan role=\"img\" aria-label=\"rocket emoji\">🚀\u003C/span> emoji\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\u003Cblockquote>\n\u003Cp>Click the card above to open the detailed view.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/blockquote>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>A bare link (no detail) should still open a modal showing the fetched\nOG info plus a \u003Cem>Visit site\u003C/em> button.\u003C/p>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phase-4--media-embedding\">Phase 4 — Media Embedding\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>YouTube/bare-link auto-embed, Bilibili, self-hosted video, ambient player, and subtitle mining with live transcript.\u003C/p>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"phase-5--i18n--pinyin-ruby\">Phase 5 — i18n &#x26; Pinyin Ruby\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>The entire UI now supports three languages:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>English\u003C/strong> (EN) — default locale\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>German\u003C/strong> (DE) — full translation\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Chinese\u003C/strong> (ZH) — full translation with pinyin ruby support\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"url-structure\">URL Structure\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>All pages now use locale-prefixed URLs:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>/personal_garden/en/\u003C/code> — English home\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>/personal_garden/de/\u003C/code> — German home\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>/personal_garden/zh/\u003C/code> — Chinese home\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"pinyin-ruby\">Pinyin Ruby\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>The \u003Ccode>:zh[...]{pinyin=\"...\"}\u003C/code> syntax renders Chinese characters with pinyin annotations above them using HTML \u003Ccode>&#x3C;ruby>\u003C/code> elements.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"language-switcher\">Language Switcher\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>A language switcher component has been added to the header, allowing users to toggle between EN, DE, and ZH.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tag-translations\">Tag Translations\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Tags are automatically translated based on the current locale. For example, “development” becomes “Entwicklung” in German and “开发” in Chinese.\u003C/p>",{"headings":24,"localImagePaths":90,"remoteImagePaths":91,"frontmatter":92,"imagePaths":96},[25,29,33,36,39,42,45,48,51,54,57,60,63,66,69,72,75,78,81,84,87],{"depth":26,"slug":27,"text":28},2,"phase-1--code-block-enhancements","Phase 1 — Code Block Enhancements",{"depth":30,"slug":31,"text":32},3,"line-highlight-1-3","Line highlight {1-3}",{"depth":30,"slug":34,"text":35},"word-highlight-const","Word highlight /const",{"depth":30,"slug":37,"text":38},"combined-highlight-lines-2-3-and-the-word-return","Combined: highlight lines 2-3 and the word return",{"depth":30,"slug":40,"text":41},"plain-block-still-gets-copy--badge--line-numbers","Plain block (still gets copy 